sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant B as Backend (FastAPI + pipeline)
  participant W as Writer (Opus)
  participant PN as Review panel x3 (Opus)
  participant AU as Auditors x5 (Haiku)
  participant DB as db.json
  U->>B: Paste a JD
  B->>DB: Read saved profile
  DB-->>B: Profile and resume
  par In parallel
    B->>W: Produce JD analysis
    W-->>B: Match analysis
  and
    B->>PN: Score the resume
    PN-->>B: ATS, recruiter, manager scores
  end
  B->>AU: Audit each output
  AU-->>B: Five scores and issues
  B->>B: Quote check, word for word
  opt Any score not above 95, or a quote not found
    B->>W: Rewrite once, with the issue list
    W-->>B: Corrected output
    B->>AU: Audit again
    AU-->>B: Final audit result
  end
  B->>B: Gate: average 80+ and lowest 70+
  B->>DB: Save the record
  B-->>U: Result and apply tier
